    "description": "<div style=\"padding: 30px 32px 30px 32px;\">1. Read&nbsp;Instructions for creating GitHub repositories<br>2. Go to <a class=\"auto_open\" href=\"https://classroom.github.com/a/tyeJ6GLs\">https://classroom.github.com/a/tyeJ6GLs</a>&nbsp;to create your repository<br>3. Update the readme file of the github repository with your name, ccid and class information<br><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">SUBMIT</strong><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">&nbsp;the repository URL through eClass</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">.</span><br>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
